init.description:
Select which power sensors (in Watts/kW) should have energy sensors (kWh) generated. Energy sensors will be created automatically when you submit. Found {count} power sensors in your system. Use "Configure constant power devices" to pair switches with fixed wattage loads (e.g. {constant_hint}). Current constant devices:
{constant_summary}

Electricity price add-ons:
{price_adjust_summary}

advanced.description:
Configure advanced settings for energy sensor generation. Sensors will be created automatically when you submit. Constant power devices: {constant_summary}

Electricity price add-ons:
{price_adjust_summary}

constant_devices.description:
Add or remove switch entities that represent a fixed-power load. Existing entries:
{constant_summary}
{constant_status}

price_adjustments.description:
Create sensors that mirror another price sensor (e.g. Nordpool) and add a fixed amount (transmission/tax). Existing entries:
{price_adjust_summary}
{price_adjust_status}
